<title>SWEDEN: Finnish airports move 3.6 more cargo in June.</title>
<headline>Finnish airports move 3.6 more cargo in June.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's domestic and international airports handled 7,445 tonnes of freight in June, a 3.6 percent rise on the same month a year ago, Finland's civil aviation administration said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity.</p>
<p>					   JUNE		 JAN-JUNE</p>
<p>				  1997    Pct change   1997  Pct change</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	  7,445	  3.6    44,815	 7.1</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	   1,494	  4.0     9,261	 1.6</p>
<p> Landings		    26,961	  9.1   136,168	-2.2</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions) 1.045	 12.3     5.746	 9.2</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
